ConsumerConfig.description:
A consumer as declared in `gateway.yaml` under `consumers:`.

```yaml
consumers:
  - name: alice
    group: partners
    labels: { custom_id: "42", tier: gold }
    credentials:
      key-auth: { key: "s3cret" }
      basic-auth: { username: alice, password: pw }
```

post.description:
Errors: `409 Conflict` if a route with the same name already exists;
`400 Bad Request` if the resulting configuration fails
validation/recompilation (the previous compiled routes stay active).
